OL,3,AJournalists denied White House access
OL,4,Aafter Trump banned some media outlets
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump said on Friday he was barring all
OL,7,Fthree major US media outlets from the
OL,8,FWhite House, accusing them of writing
OL,9,F"fiction or lies" about his
OL,10,Fadministration.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
