OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AConverse pulls 'deeply upsetting'
OL,4,Aadvert after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an apology, first issued on Friday,
OL,7,FConverse said the photo had been
OL,8,Fremoved from its social media channels
OL,9,Fand it was working to remove it
OL,10,Felsewhere. "This should not have
OL,11,Fhappened and we will do better," it
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
